The doorbell rings.
I open the door.
Neha and Amit are standing outside.
I welcome them with a smile.
"Welcome, please come inside," I say.
They enter the house.
Neha says, "The aroma is very good, Maya!"
Amit says, "Yes, I am very hungry."
I lead them to the small dining table.
"Please sit here," I say.
First, I bring three plates from the kitchen.
Then, I bring three glasses and one jug of water.
After that, I place all the items on the table.
"First drink water," I say.
Amit pours water into the glasses from the jug.
Neha smiles and says, "Thank you."
Now, we are ready for the meal.
